cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "Sphragis: corpus and measurement for organization-specific code review adaptation"
abstract: >-
  The corpus harness, measurement instruments and experiment behind a pre-registered
  study of whether a language-model adapter trained on one organization's code review
  history learns that organization's conventions, and what a declared provenance
  boundary protects once it can.
type: software
